WEBVTT

00:00.100 --> 00:02.200
Green Tracker on your iPhone. 20 seconds, in Safari.

00:02.500 --> 00:05.300
Step 1 of 3: open it in Safari. Tap Sign up free on our website.

00:05.400 --> 00:08.200
Step 2 of 3: tap Share. Tap ⋯ at the bottom, then Share.
(Share button in the bar? Tap it.)

00:08.300 --> 00:09.900
Tap View More, the last round button.

00:10.000 --> 00:12.700
Then tap Add to Home Screen, in the list that opens.

00:12.800 --> 00:15.800
Step 3 of 3: tap Add, top right. Leave Open as Web App on.

00:15.900 --> 00:18.700
Done. It’s on your Home Screen: look for the green leaf.

00:18.800 --> 00:20.900
It opens full screen. No Safari bars. Just your stash.

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
Get it in 3 steps: open it in Safari, Share → Add to Home Screen, tap Add.
Roll one up and rate it.
